      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a documentary script about the Algerian War of Independence. Can you give me a detailed timeline of the main events from 1954 to 1962, but please focus heavily on the perspective of the FLN and the Algerian people fighting against the French colonial administration? I want to make sure the narrative really captures their struggle for liberation.",
